[00:00.000]...
[00:22.392]Look over there that one big hole
{"看那边有个大洞"}
[00:27.551]Somebody's got to move this huge stone
{"总得有人搬走这块巨石"}
[00:32.847]A dog? A hound?
{"是狗？是猎犬？"}
[00:35.542]I hear the sound
{"我听见声响"}
[00:38.121]It is a half mile away from home
{"离家还有半英里远"}
[00:42.952]What was everything you were fighting for?
{"你究竟为何而战？"}
[00:48.486]The sun in the sky, it makes me so blue
{"天上太阳让我忧郁"}
[00:53.481]Rotten everything that I liked you for
{"喜欢你的一切都已腐烂"}
[00:58.923]You can't give up!
{"你不能放弃！"}
[01:01.550]Now you see
{"现在你明白"}
[01:03.061]Chasing the light
{"追逐光芒"}
[01:04.827]It's blowing right through the air
{"它正随风飘散"}
[01:07.499]We gonna keep on fighting for our dreams
{"我们将继续为梦想而战"}
[01:12.588]Come on! We'll get on all fours
{"来吧！我们四肢着地"}
[01:15.190]And then we will crawl in the grass
{"然后在草丛中爬行"}
[01:17.887]Until lost in my mind
{"直到迷失在脑海"}
[01:21.743]I am just losing myself
{"我正逐渐失去自我"}
[01:35.472]I try to care
{"我试着在乎"}
[01:37.383]They look so young
{"他们如此年轻"}
[01:40.730]And left there toys and picked up a gun
{"却扔下玩具拿起枪"}
[01:45.841]They kiss goodbye a lullaby
{"他们吻别摇篮曲"}
[01:51.138]I have to train them
{"我必须训练他们"}
[01:53.461]All in bloody war
{"投入血腥战争"}
[01:56.133]What was everything you were fighting for?
{"你究竟为何而战？"}
[02:01.524]The sun in the sky, it makes me so blue
{"天上太阳让我忧郁"}
[02:06.427]Rotten everything that I liked you for
{"我曾喜欢的一切都已腐朽"}
[02:12.052]You can't give up!
{"你不能放弃！"}
[02:14.679]Now you see
{"现在你明白"}
[02:16.259]Chasing the light
{"追逐光芒"}
[02:17.864]It's blowing right through the air
{"它正穿透空气"}
[02:20.514]We gonna keep on fighting for our dreams
{"我们将继续为梦想而战"}
[02:25.717]Come on! We'll get on all fours
{"来吧！我们会匍匐前进"}
[02:28.297]And then we will crawl in the grass
{"然后在草丛中爬行"}
[02:30.945]Until lost in my mind
{"直到迷失在思绪里"}
[02:34.801]I am just losing myself
{"我正逐渐失去自我"}
