[03:17.227]Now you see
{"现在你明白"}
[03:18.738]Chasing the light
{"追逐光芒"}
[03:20.459]It's blowing right through the air
{"它正穿透空气"}
[03:23.132]We gonna keep on fighting for our dreams
{"我们将继续为梦想而战"}
[03:28.220]Come on! We'll get on all fours
{"来吧！我们会匍匐前进"}
[03:30.868]And then we will crawl in the grass
{"然后在草丛中爬行"}
[03:33.493]Until lost in my mind
{"直到迷失在思绪里"}
[03:37.395]I am just losing myself
{"我正逐渐失去自我"}
[03:40.726]I heard all the bells calling
{"我听见所有钟声在召唤"}
[03:43.305]Our nightmares of walls falling
{"我们墙垣倾塌的梦魇"}
[03:45.888]You came back and gave your help
{"你归来伸出援手"}
[03:48.516]But you're lying on the ground
{"却倒卧在血泊之中"}
[03:51.145]We turn back the tide of hell
{"我们逆转地狱的狂潮"}
[03:53.750]And win back our fantasy
{"夺回属于我们的幻梦"}
[03:56.288]We fight for our right to be a free people again
{"为重新成为自由民族而战"}
[04:01.585]And now we can see (People shouting everywhere)
{"如今我们终于看见（人群在四处呐喊）"}
[04:05.719]So much blood shed I can't bear
{"太多鲜血令我窒息"}
[04:08.344]I can not erase the words you said to me
{"无法抹去你留下的箴言"}
[04:12.085]But now you're dead
{"但如今你已长眠"}
[04:13.619]You will stand the endless rain
{"你将承受永无止境的雨"}
[04:16.151]Wish I could have helped you more
{"多希望当时能再多帮你一些"}
[04:18.776]When you died only the day before
{"就在你逝去的前一天"}
